# ── sway-only notes ──
# - Hyprland window groups → tabbed layout (Super+G). No group-index binds.
# - Cursor zoom + single-window square aspect have no sway equivalent.
# - Super+slash opens the cheatsheet (it shadowed monitor-scale in Hyprland too);
#   monitor scaling lives on Super+Ctrl+Alt+Up/Down.

# NOTE: no image `output * bg` / `include .../wallpaper` here (see Outputs
# above — a swaybg image would cover awww after the next reload and freeze
# the picture). The current image path is tracked in
# ~/.cache/current-wallpaper and repainted at login by init-wallpaper.sh
# through the full sway-wall.sh switch. If awww is ever down, sway-wall.sh
# falls back to a one-shot `swaymsg output * bg` for that switch only.
